        "original_id": "f7fa0b2d-3b0b-5b5a-aed8-96c5dacdbfbe",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Liam Cunningham, Michael Fassbender, Nick Reding, Keith Barron\n- Works: Police 2020\n- Roles: DCI Billy O'Connell, Eddie Longshaw\n- Topics: Irish actors, television and film appearances\n\nFacts:\n- Liam Cunningham, born on 2 June 1961, is an Irish stage and screen actor.\n- Michael Fassbender, born on 2 April 1977, is an Irish actor.\n- In Police 2020, Liam Cunningham starred as DCI Billy O'Connell, the head of a police nightshift force in a near-future setting.\n- In Police 2020, Keith Barron played Eddie Longshaw, an armed suspect who took Russian immigrants hostage in an elevator after blaming immigrants for a tuberculosis outbreak that killed most of his family.\n- Nick Reding's television and film appearances included Police 2020, The Monocled Mutineer, Bodyguards, Oscar, Peak Practice, Minder, Tales from the Crypt, Croupier, The Constant Gardener, Blood Diamond, and Soul Boy.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
